# A chat on a phone (MBUI_FIXTURE=chat MBUI_WIN=390x844): its composer pressed (a capsule opening to a box), two lines
# written, sent (the box back to its one line as they fly to their row), pressed beside and let go (sfpages'
# composer_node with MBUI_CHAT_PAGE=composed, the old view's with MBUI_CHAT_PAGE=nodes).
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 600
tap 发消息
wait 900
type 帮我看一下登录按钮
key enter
wait 300
type 还有注册页
wait 700
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 1500
exit
